# Science-Agent-Pipeline is folded into this repo as regular files (it used
# to be tracked as a gitlink to its own separate repo, which broke CI --
# GitHub Actions checkout tried to resolve the gitlink and there was no
# .gitmodules pointing anywhere real). Its own node_modules/build output are
# covered by Science-Agent-Pipeline/.gitignore; this repo's pnpm store cache
# (created while verifying the merge) should never be committed either.
.pnpm-store/
